[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27725.11, "timestamp": "07:42:05", "text": "我的天，太搞笑了。真搞笑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27727.75, "timestamp": "07:42:07", "text": "不，我好像有点卡顿。稍等片刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27730.628, "timestamp": "07:42:10", "text": "我把它放在了最底层。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27733.99, "timestamp": "07:42:13", "text": "是的，我需要这款游戏出现延迟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27736.07, "timestamp": "07:42:16", "text": "不，不，不。我不明白，我不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27738.708, "timestamp": "07:42:18", "text": "这下可惹火了。或许吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27741.26, "timestamp": "07:42:21", "text": "就像是延迟加载一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27742.548, "timestamp": "07:42:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27755.948, "timestamp": "07:42:35", "text": "嗯，工作。一切都在按计划进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27761.628, "timestamp": "07:42:41", "text": "哦，好快。我想速度快。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27765.27, "timestamp": "07:42:45", "text": "拉屎。我恨你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27767.51, "timestamp": "07:42:47", "text": "你自杀了，然后你也杀了我。"}]